  "title": "AI Data Extraction and Post-Session Processing: Learn From Every Chat | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "A chat holds names, emails and needs, and when it ends it has an outcome. This video shows the Data Processing and Metrics tab of a CrestApps AI profile: extracting details while people chat, analyzing the chat after it closes, and measuring resolution, ratings and conversion.\n\nIn this video:\n• The three moments: during, after and over time\n• Session inactivity timeout and data extraction entries\n• Post-session tasks: Semantic and Predefined Options\n• Session metrics, resolution detection and conversion goals\n• Where the results go: reports and workflows",
